      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Historical vs Current List",
      "id": "historical-current",
      "intro": "Toggle untuk switch antara Current List (alerts aktif yang sedang ditangani) dan Historical List (alerts yang sudah selesai atau archived). Berguna untuk review past cases dan reporting.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Current vs Historical List",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Current List**: Alerts yang aktif, belum selesai, masih dalam handling\n• **Historical List**: Alerts yang sudah classified, closed, atau archived\n• Toggle menggunakan Segmented Control di toolbar\n• Fetch data berbeda berdasarkan mode\n• Historical mode untuk audit & reporting",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Historical Mode</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Current & Historical Toggle</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;\"><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Current List</button><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;cursor:pointer;\">Historical List</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Current List - Active Alerts",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Default view ketika buka Alert Acquirer\n• Menampilkan alerts yang:\n  - Belum classified atau\n  - Sedang dalam progress handling\n  - Status: OPEN, ASSIGNED, IN_PROGRESS\n• Support semua fitur operasional:\n  - Classify, Assign, Lock/Unlock\n  - Bulk operations\n  - Discussion & Action Request\n• Real-time updates dari alert generation engine",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;background:linear-gradient(to right,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">CURRENT</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Active alerts in handling</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">24 Alerts</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12345</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⏳ IN PROGRESS</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Suspicious Transaction • Assigned: John</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12346</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">📂 OPEN</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">High Risk Account • Unassigned</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12347</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">👤 ASSIGNED</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Multiple Declined • Assigned: Sarah</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Historical List - Archived Alerts",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Click **Historical List** di segmented control\n• Menampilkan alerts yang:\n  - Sudah classified (POSITIVE, NEGATIVE, SUSPICIOUS)\n  - Status: CLOSED, COMPLETED, ARCHIVED\n  - Case sudah selesai dihandle\n• Read-only mode untuk sebagian besar operations\n• Bisa view detail, download reports, export data\n• Tidak bisa classify ulang atau bulk operations",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;background:linear-gradient(to right,#eef2ff,#f5f3ff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#6366f1;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">HISTORICAL</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Archived & completed alerts</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">156 Alerts</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12300</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">✓ POSITIVE</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Completed: 2024-01-10 • By: John</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12301</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ NEGATIVE</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Completed: 2024-01-11 • By: Sarah</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">#12302</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">✓ SUSPICIOUS</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Completed: 2024-01-12 • By: Mike</div></div></div></div>"
          }
